{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17463","headline":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 六 · 权德舆","name":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江春好游衍，处处芳菲积。\n彩舫入花津，香车依柳陌。\n绿杨烟褭褭，红蘂莺寂寂。\n如何愁思人，独与风光隔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}